        "ai_gen_block_80c3393_78Rq9z": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_80c3393",
          "settings": {
            "eyebrow": "NX-01 / Questions Answered",
            "heading": "Before you decide.",
            "intro": "Clear answers for a more informed choice.",
            "question_1": "What is NX-01 designed to replace?",
            "answer_1": "<p>NX-01 is designed as a focused alternative to a routine built around multiple separate nootropic products. It is not intended to replace prescribed medication or professional medical advice.</p>",
            "question_2": "Does NX-01 contain caffeine?",
            "answer_2": "<p>No. NX-01 is formulated without caffeine, so it does not rely on a stimulant effect to support your routine.</p>",
            "question_3": "Does NX-01 contain Phenibut?",
            "answer_3": "<p>No. NX-01 does not contain Phenibut.</p>",
            "question_4": "Can I drink coffee while using NX-01?",
            "answer_4": "<p>NX-01 contains no caffeine, but your total caffeine intake still matters. If you are sensitive to caffeine or take medication, check with a qualified healthcare professional.</p>",
            "question_5": "Can I combine it with other nootropics?",
            "answer_5": "<p>We recommend introducing one change at a time and reviewing all ingredients with a qualified healthcare professional before combining products.</p>",
            "question_6": "Why three capsules?",
            "answer_6": "<p>The three-capsule serving allows the formula to deliver its selected ingredients in practical amounts while keeping the product straightforward to use.</p>",
            "question_7": "Why CDP-Choline instead of Alpha-GPC?",
            "answer_7": "<p>NX-01 uses CDP-Choline because it is the choline source selected for this formula. Ingredient choice should always be considered in the context of the complete formula and your individual needs.</p>",
            "question_8": "Is NX-01 designed for daily or occasional use?",
            "answer_8": "<p>NX-01 is designed to fit a consistent daily routine when used as directed. Follow the product label and seek professional guidance if you have a medical condition or take medication.</p>",
            "question_9": "How long does one bottle last?",
            "answer_9": "<p>One bottle lasts for the number of servings stated on the product label. Your usage period depends on the recommended serving size and how consistently you use it.</p>",
            "question_10": "When should I take it?",
            "answer_10": "<p>Take NX-01 according to the product label, ideally at a consistent time that suits your routine. Do not exceed the recommended serving.</p>",
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
